<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-WestLB branch rated AA plus by S&amp;P.</title>
<headline>RTRS-WestLB branch rated AA plus by S&amp;P.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard and Poor's Corp said on Wednesday it had assigned AA-plus long-term and A-1-plus short-term ratings to the Australian branch of Westdeutsche Landesbank Girozentrale (WestLB).  </p>
<p>The Australian branch began operations in October this year.</p>
<p>S&amp;P said the ratings apply to the Australian dollar deposits and other local currency unsecured obligations of the bank in Australia. The ratings outlook is stable.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
